  <item>
    <title>听说宇宙的尽头是铁岭？爱因斯坦：呵，文科生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6288ac072e0dbe2594776b22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6288ac072e0dbe2594776b22</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 May 2022 08:49:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>“我们从坚果剥出时间并教它走路：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>而时间回到壳中。</span><br><span>镜中是星期天，</span><br><span>梦里有地方睡眠，</span><br><span>我们口说真理。”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>——保罗·策兰</span></strong></p><br><p><strong><span>本期砸中我们的书：</span></strong></p><p><span>《爱因斯坦的梦》【美】&nbsp;阿兰·莱特曼</span></p><br><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><p><span>老皂、和月</span></p><br><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">0:41</a> 被封控的机械时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">3:56</a> 小职员爱因斯坦的论文，灵感来源竟然是梦？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">6:51</a> 30个时间法则，30个不同的世界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a> 三维时间和平行宇宙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 如果时间是一种感觉，它会膨胀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 你是否愿意活在时间没有尽头的世界里？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 摆烂与自由意志</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> 爱因斯坦走进小径分叉的花园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 愿大家在不确定的世界里，做一个确定的梦</span></p><br><p><strong><span>本期提到的作品：</span></strong></p><p><span>书 《爱因斯坦自选集：我的思想与观念》</span></p><p><span>纪录片《爱因斯坦与霍金：掌握宇宙奥秘的人》</span></p><p><span>纪录片《神秘的混沌理论》</span><br><br></p><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><p><span>Red Garland -&nbsp;Can't See for Lookin' (Album of 1958)</span></p>]]></description>
