  <item>
    <title>悲伤，我没有住进豪华方舱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626790cf226c1e4d9c992f4b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626790cf226c1e4d9c992f4b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Apr 2022 05:32:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>乡亲们，老皂从方舱回来了！！本期节目播客《2040书店FM》联动《突然读本书》，主播元婴、玄机连线老皂，公开处刑方舱厕所、伙食等等等等，听到就是笑到！</span></p><p><br><b><span>&gt;时间轴</span></b><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 联动播客介绍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 听我说谢谢你，我的阳性邻居</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 我的新冠症状及康复历程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 这玩意儿到底有没有后遗症</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 抗议日记结束，方舱日记开始</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 场地、饮食、规矩——我的方舱初接触</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 睡衣是我最后的仪式感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 上厕所真是所有人的难题</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 两大恶魔——功放抖音和核酸结果</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 绿皮车也苦不过我的行军床</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> 我想打发时间，就和大家聊天</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 我在方舱看电影</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 六天后，我出舱了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a> 解封才发现生活早就被我们糟蹋完了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> 疫情过去后我们不切实际的愿望</span><br></p><br><p><b><span>&gt;本期提到的作家</span></b></p><p><span>余华</span></p><p><span>杨绛</span></p><br><p><b><span>&gt;本期提到的电影</span></b><br></p><span>《蝙蝠侠》</span><br>]]></description>
